    <node id="&quot;SIGAA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SIGAA (Sistema Integrado de Gestão Acadêmica Aplicada) is a technology used for academic management at UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is a portal for students where they can check their grades and other academic information."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is a technology platform used for accessing the PPC of a course."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sigaa is a system used by the University of Brasília (UnB) for academic management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sistema de Administração de Atividades Acadêmicas (SIGAA) is a system for managing academic activities at the University of Brazil."&lt;SEP&gt;"The SIGAA is a portal used by students of Unb."&lt;SEP&gt;"The SIGAA system also handles the submission and registration of these documents as per the instructions given."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sistema Integrado de Gerenciamento de Atividades Acadêmicas (Integrated Academic Activities Management System) is a software used by the University of Brasília."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Information Management System (SIGAA), which students use to register for internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Information System (SIGAA), a software used by UnB for managing academic processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The System for Academic Administration (SIGAA) is the system where students register for their internships."&lt;SEP&gt;The SIGAA is the student self-service portal at the University of Brasília (UnB).</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49c404738092a3fab90cd0e5ca0d0d7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ed024080994acf4b7f84fdfdadf700&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47cdf8c51a32308ea4b4699ed897edce</data>
    </node>
