      <data key="d2">chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMPONENTE CURRICULAR OBRIGATÓRIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A mandatory component curricular refers to a required course or activity in the curriculum."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMPONENTE CURRICULAR OPTATIVO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An optional component curricular refers to an elective course or activity in the curriculum."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMPONENTE ELETIVO (MÓDULO LIVRE)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An elective component (module free) refers to a course or activity that is not listed in the curriculum but can be taken for credit."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CARGA HORÁRIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Carga horária refers to the amount of time students spend on their internships, with limits specified by law and university regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Workload refers to the total number of hours of study required for a course."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DISCIPLINA&quot;">
