      <data key="d2">chunk-24ed024080994acf4b7f84fdfdadf700</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MATRÍCULA EXTRAORDINÁRIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Matrícula extraordinária is a process where students can enroll in remaining vacancies without prioritization."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-24ed024080994acf4b7f84fdfdadf700</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROCESSAMENTO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Processamento refers to the processing of matriculation requests."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ESTUDANTE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Estudante is the individual who requests and completes matriculation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COORDENAÇÃO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Coordenação refers to the department or office responsible for coordinating certain aspects of the matriculation process."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ESTÁGIOS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Estágios refers to internships or practicums, which are part of the matriculation process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Estágios refers to the plural form of internships, encompassing both required and non-required opportunities."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
