      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"TCC refers to a thesis component of the matriculation process."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ATIVIDADES DE ORIENTAÇÃO INDIVIDUAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Atividades de orientação individual refer to individual counseling or guidance sessions as part of the matriculation process."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DISCIPLINAS QUE ENVOLVEM FORMAÇÃO DE TURMAS ESPECÍFICAS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Disciplinas que envolvem formação de turmas específicas refer to courses that require the formation of specific groups or teams as part of the matriculation process."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESERVA DE VAGAS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Reserva de vagas refers to reserved spots or spaces in certain courses, available only for students of a specific course."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DATAS E PRAXOS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Datas e praxos refers to the dates and deadlines for each step of the matriculation process."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CALENDÁRIO DE MATRÍCULA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Calendário de matrícula is the calendar of matriculation, which includes all the dates and procedures related to enrollment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANO LETIVO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ano letivo refers to the academic year, which consists of two semesters of approximately 100 days each (counting Saturdays), usually indicated with the year followed by a number: ex. 2023.1 or 2023.2."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SEMESTRE DE VERÃO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Semestre de verão refers to the summer semester, which is offered in approximately two months and indicated with the number four: ex. 2023.4."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESULTADOS ALCANÇADOS NO VERÃO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Resultados alcançados no verão refers to the results achieved during the summer semester, which count towards the following academic year."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANTES DA MATRÍCULA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Antes da matricula refers to the preparation stage before the official matriculation process."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AVALIAÇÃO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Avaliação refers to the evaluation of learning, which is an essential part of the academic process."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ATIVIDADES AVALIATIVAS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Atividades avaliativas are the evaluative activities that can vary depending on the component and the methodology adopted by the professor."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MENÇÕES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Menções refer to the categories of academic performance, which group students with similar grades."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;APROVADO(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Aprovado(a) refers to being approved in a component or course."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;REPROVADO(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Reprovado(a) refers to being disapproved or failing in a component or course."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STUDENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Student refers to any individual who is studying at UnB."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FACULTY MEMBER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Faculty Member is a role for individuals who teach at UnB."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COURSE COORDINATOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Course Coordinator is a role for individuals responsible for coordinating courses at UnB."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SEI (SISTEMA ELETRÔNICO DE INFORMAÇÃO)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SEI (Sistem Eletrônicode Informação) is the electronic system that processes all university transactions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SIGAA (SISTEMA INTEGRADO DE GESTÃO ACADÊMICA APLICADA)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SIGAA (Sistema Integrado de Gestão Acadêmica Aplicada) is a technology used for academic management at UnB."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ACADEMIC RECORDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Academic Records refer to the official documents that contain information about a student's progress and performance in their courses at UnB."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRANSACTIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Transactions refer to any action or process related to academic, administrative, or financial matters conducted through SEI (Sistema Eletrônico de Informação)"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;E-MAIL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Email communication, used to contact the company or organization regarding internship matters."&lt;SEP&gt;This e-mail is for the purpose of signing electronically or physically.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIPLOMA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">The diploma in question is digital and offers several benefits such as quick issuance, no cost, unlimited copies, and printability in any size.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSIDADE DE BRASÍLIA (UNB)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Federal University of Brasília."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Universidade de Brasília (UnB) is a higher education institution that provides opportunities for students to complete required and non-required internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Universidade de Brasília (UnB) is an educational institution where students are guided on the use of the Sistema Integrado de Gestão de Atividades Acadêmicas (SIGAA)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Universidade de Brasília (UnB) is an educational institution where students can complete internships and submit periodic or final reports."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Universidade de Brasília (UnB) is the broader institution in which the DAIA and CESG are located."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasilia (UnB) is the organization mentioned in the text, offering opportunities for academic and scientific research, exchange programs, and community service."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasilia, where the student is registering their internship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasília (UnB) is a university where the document was submitted."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasília (UnB) is the institution where students are required to complete their studies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasília (UnB) is the location where the mandatory internship registration takes place."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasília (UnB) is the organization where the text document was written."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasília (UnB), a higher education institution."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasília is the institution where the text document comes from."&lt;SEP&gt;"Universidade de Brasília is the organization where the study plan is implemented."&lt;SEP&gt;The University of Brasília (UnB) is the institution where the diploma is issued.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6bd9c133e851de0c23f808943eeda2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69065f8900adcc5c23cde0bc047686d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab673f3f31e4b6cfe2fab27d4c223fbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90c9b5d9dcc0ebcd94a23ecb667edc84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a5dd6915ab901bad633c800a1755091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac407f61310418797bb84a4df139e830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5bb0f4549b11ac50894507586c40c60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47cdf8c51a32308ea4b4699ed897edce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SAA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">The SAA is also mentioned as a place where students can directly submit the student self-service portal SIGAA.&lt;SEP&gt;The SAA is mentioned as the entity that handles the issuance of diplomas.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SECRETARIA DO CURSO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">The Secretariat of the Course is mentioned as a place where revisions of grades can be requested.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COLEGIADO DO CURSO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">The Colegiado do curso is an entity responsible for the elaboration of norms within the course.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FORMULÁRIO DE REVISÃO DE MENÇÃO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">The form for grade revision is a part of the process to request a revision of one's grade.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRANCAMENTO DE MATRÍCULA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">Trancamento de matrícula refers to suspension of a student's enrollment at the University of Brasília (UnB).</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRANCAMENTO GERAL DE MATRÍCULA (TGM)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">Trancamento geral de matrícula (TGM) is a type of enrollment suspension that lasts for one semester.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRANCAMENTO PARCIAL DE MATRÍCULA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">Trancamento parcial de matrícula is a type of enrollment suspension that affects only some components of the curriculum.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRANCAMENTO AUTOMÁTICO DE DISCIPLINA (TR)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">Trancamento automático de disciplina (TR) is a type of enrollment suspension for a specific course.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRANCAMENTO PARCIAL DE MATRÍCULA EXCEPCIONAL E JUSTIFICADO (TJ)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">Trancamento parcial de matrícula excepcional e justificado (TJ) is a type of enrollment suspension for specific course components with valid reasons.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;APROVEITAMENTO DE ESTUDOS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">Aproveitamento de estudos is the process to transfer credits from other institutions for courses already taken.&lt;SEP&gt;The event of requesting approval of studies is discussed in the text.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8737c0a41a63b20de6e94c4437660b84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRANCAMENTO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">The event of granting permission for repeated withdrawal is discussed in the text.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8737c0a41a63b20de6e94c4437660b84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DETALHES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">The concept of details is mentioned as something that can be found on the website wyw.deg.unb.br regarding the process of trancamento.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8737c0a41a63b20de6e94c4437660b84</data>
    </node>
