    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ESTÁGIO NÃO OBRIGATÓRIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An optional or complementary internship regulated by each course and aimed at enhancing academic and professional formation, undertaken voluntarily."&lt;SEP&gt;"Estágio Não Obrigatório is a type of non-required internship that requires the company's sponsorship such as scholarships and transportation benefits."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5219cf0817cbb82473514dd9f7028dc0</data>
    </node>
