      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Decanato de Extensão (DEX) is another department of the University of Brasilia, focusing on community outreach and partnerships."&lt;SEP&gt;"The extension dean's office at the University of Brasília (UnB)."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ab673f3f31e4b6cfe2fab27d4c223fbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69065f8900adcc5c23cde0bc047686d0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ASSOCIAÇÃO NACIONAL DE DIRIGENTES DE INSTITUIÇÕES FEDERAIS DE ENSINO SUPERIOR (ANDIFES)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A national association representing directors of federal higher education institutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Associação Nacional de Dirigentes de Instituições Federais de Ensino Superior (Andifes) is an association of federal higher education institutions, possibly involved in academic mobility within Brazil."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ab673f3f31e4b6cfe2fab27d4c223fbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69065f8900adcc5c23cde0bc047686d0</data>
    </node>
